+ ChatPrompt is Box

+ message AIChatMessage
+ caches ChatBlockCaches
+ images AIImageStore?
+ state = ChatPromptState()
+ is-collapsed = false
+ is-open = false
+ is-long = false
+ is-expanded = #state.#is-expanded
